            sentence-id="t0b0d1p0s0"
            class="sentence__translation editable__translation"
            xml:lang="eng"
          >Then Deer tried to steal Rabbit’s shoes.</s>
                    <s id="t0b0d1p0s1"><w
              id="t0b0d1p0s1w0"
              ARPABET="M OW N T"
              time="30.99"
              dur="0.59"
            >Mont</w> “<w
              id="t0b0d1p0s1w1"
              ARPABET="EY S T EY L EY P IY K V"
              time="31.58"
              dur="0.88"
            >Estelepikv</w> <w
              id="t0b0d1p0s1w2"
              ARPABET="HH EY D AA K UW S EY N"
              time="32.46"
              dur="1.1"
            >hera̜kusēn</w> <w
              id="t0b0d1p0s1w3"
              ARPABET="OW N T S K EY S"
              time="33.56"
              dur="0.7"
            >ontskes</w>. <w
              id="t0b0d1p0s1w4"
              ARPABET="V N P AA L EY T S K EY N"
              time="35.01"
              dur="1.05"
            >Vnpaletsken</w> <w
              id="t0b0d1p0s1w5"
              ARPABET="CH EY M"
              time="36.5"
              dur="0.26"
            >cem</w> <w
              id="t0b0d1p0s1w6"
              ARPABET="V T EY HH EY P IY T"
              time="36.88"
              dur="0.97"
            >vtehēpit</w> <w
              id="t0b0d1p0s1w7"
              ARPABET="HH EY CH V D AA N IY S"
              time="38.29"
              dur="1.08"
            >hecvranis</w>”</s><s
            do-not-align="true"
            id="t0b0d1p0s1"
            sentence-id="t0b0d1p0s1"
            class="sentence__translation editable__translation"
            xml:lang="eng"
          >“You have such pretty shoes. Lend them to me, and I’ll try them on,” </s>
                    <s id="t0b0d1p0s2"><w
              id="t0b0d1p0s2w0"
              ARPABET="K IY HH CH EY N HH"
              time="39.8"
              dur="0.3"
            >kihcen,</w> “<w
              id="t0b0d1p0s2w1"
              ARPABET="V N M EY HH CH EY W IY T EY S"
              time="40.1"
              dur="1.24"
            >Vnmehcewitēs</w>” <w
              id="t0b0d1p0s2w2"
              ARPABET="K OW N T"
              time="41.34"
              dur="0.45"
            >kont</w> <w
              id="t0b0d1p0s2w3"
              ARPABET="OW M IY S"
              time="41.79"
              dur="0.78"
            >omis</w> ’<w
              id="t0b0d1p0s2w4"
              ARPABET="M V K V S AA HH M EY N HH"
              time="42.57"
              dur="1.11"
            >mvkvsahmen,</w></s><s
            do-not-align="true"
            id="t0b0d1p0s2"
            sentence-id="t0b0d1p0s2"
            class="sentence__translation editable__translation"
            xml:lang="eng"
          >Rabbit thought, “He might take them from me,” but agreed,</s>
                    <s id="t0b0d1p0s3"><w
              id="t0b0d1p0s3w0"
              ARPABET="V T EY HH HH EY T"
              time="44.51"
              dur="0.69"
            >vtehhet</w> <w
              id="t0b0d1p0s3w1"
              ARPABET="EY S L EY T K EY T"
              time="45.65"
              dur="0.91"
            >eslētket</w> ’<w
              id="t0b0d1p0s3w2"
              ARPABET="S AA D V T EY S"
              time="46.56"
              dur="0.93"
            >sarvtēs</w>.</s><s
            do-not-align="true"
            id="t0b0d1p0s3"
            sentence-id="t0b0d1p0s3"
            class="sentence__translation editable__translation"
            xml:lang="eng"
          >and Deer put them on and ran around with them.</s>
                </p>
            <graphic url="image-eco-ton-momen-c-20261110164718-1.png" /></div>
            <div type="page" id="t0b0d2">
