              ARPABET="OW M IY S"
              time="62.38"
              dur="0.72"
            >omis</w></s><s
            do-not-align="true"
            id="t0b0d2p0s2"
            sentence-id="t0b0d2p0s2"
            class="sentence__translation editable__translation"
            xml:lang="eng"
          >and finally ran away with them entirely. Though Rabbit chased him,</s>
                    <s id="t0b0d2p0s3"><w
              id="t0b0d2p0s3w0"
              ARPABET="CH AA K K EY K OW"
              time="63.59"
              dur="0.75"
            >cakkeko</w> <w
              id="t0b0d2p0s3w1"
              ARPABET="T AA Y EY N"
              time="64.34"
              dur="0.68"
            >tayen</w> ’<w
              id="t0b0d2p0s3w2"
              ARPABET="S AA Y EY T"
              time="65.22"
              dur="0.68"
            >sayet</w> ’<w
              id="t0b0d2p0s3w3"
              ARPABET="S EY N S UW M K EY P V T EY S"
              time="66.45"
              dur="1.59"
            >sensumkēpvtēs</w>.</s><s
            do-not-align="true"
            id="t0b0d2p0s3"
            sentence-id="t0b0d2p0s3"
            class="sentence__translation editable__translation"
            xml:lang="eng"
          >he couldn’t catch him, and Deer disappeared.</s>
                </p>
