            do-not-align="true"
            id="t0b0d3p0s0"
            sentence-id="t0b0d3p0s0"
            class="sentence__translation editable__translation"
            xml:lang="eng"
          >Now Rabbit put on Deer’s shoes and didn’t like them,</s>
                    <s id="t0b0d3p0s1">’<w
              id="t0b0d3p0s1w0"
              ARPABET="S AA D EY T"
              time="75.5"
              dur="0.63"
            >saret</w> ’<w
              id="t0b0d3p0s1w1"
              ARPABET="S V M OW N K HH AA K V T EY T"
              time="76.78"
              dur="1.73"
            >svmonkhakvtēt</w> <w
              id="t0b0d3p0s1w2"
              ARPABET="OW M EY S"
              time="78.51"
              dur="0.78"
            >omēs</w>. <w
              id="t0b0d3p0s1w3"
              ARPABET="M OW M V T EY T"
              time="79.87"
              dur="0.86"
            >Momvtēt</w> <w
              id="t0b0d3p0s1w4"
              ARPABET="OW N T"
              time="80.73"
              dur="0.44"
            >ont</w> <w
              id="t0b0d3p0s1w5"
              ARPABET="OW M EY N HH"
              time="81.17"
              dur="0.58"
            >omen,</w></s><s
            do-not-align="true"
            id="t0b0d3p0s1"
            sentence-id="t0b0d3p0s1"
            class="sentence__translation editable__translation"
            xml:lang="eng"
          >but he got used to them. That’s the way it happened,</s>
                    <s id="t0b0d3p0s2"><w
              id="t0b0d3p0s2w0"
              ARPABET="CH UW F EY"
              time="81.75"
              dur="0.39"
