            >mvkvsvmē</w> <w
              id="t0b0d4p0s2w7"
              ARPABET="T AA T EY S"
              time="102.53"
              dur="0.76"
            >tatēs</w>.</s><s
            do-not-align="true"
            id="t0b0d4p0s2"
            sentence-id="t0b0d4p0s2"
            class="sentence__translation editable__translation"
            xml:lang="eng"
          >Now Rabbit wanted Deer’s antlers, and Deer was agreeable to Rabbit.</s>
                </p>
            <graphic url="image-eco-ton-momen-c-20261110164718-4.png" /></div>
            <div type="page" id="t0b0d5">
                <p id="t0b0d5p0">
                    <s id="t0b0d5p0s0"><w
              id="t0b0d5p0s0w0"
              ARPABET="M OW N T"
              time="103.89"
              dur="0.48"
            >Mont</w> “’<w
              id="t0b0d5p0s0w1"
              ARPABET="S V N P AA L EY T S K EY N HH"
              time="105.01"
              dur="1.08"
            >Svnpaletsken,</w> ’<w
              id="t0b0d5p0s0w2"
              ARPABET="S EY K OW HH L IY CH IY N"
              time="106.83"
              dur="1.37"
            >sekohlicin</w> <w
              id="t0b0d5p0s0w3"
              ARPABET="HH EY CH V K EY S"
              time="108.2"
              dur="0.88"
            >hecvkēs</w>” <w
              id="t0b0d5p0s0w4"
              ARPABET="K IY HH CH EY N HH"
              time="109.08"
              dur="0.78"
            >kihcen,</w></s><s
            do-not-align="true"
            id="t0b0d5p0s0"
            sentence-id="t0b0d5p0s0"
            class="sentence__translation editable__translation"
            xml:lang="eng"
          >“Lend them to me, and let’s see me try them on my head,” he said, </s>
                    <s id="t0b0d5p0s1">’<w
              id="t0b0d5p0s1w0"
              ARPABET="S EY N P AA L V T EY S"
              time="110.18"
              dur="1.14"
            >senpalvtēs</w>. <w
              id="t0b0d5p0s1w1"
              ARPABET="M OW M EY N"
              time="111.72"
              dur="0.72"
            >Momen</w> <w
              id="t0b0d5p0s1w2"
              ARPABET="CH UW F EY"
              time="112.44"
              dur="0.33"
            >Cufe</w> <w
              id="t0b0d5p0s1w3"
              ARPABET="T AA T"
              time="112.77"
              dur="0.49"
            >tat</w> <w
              id="t0b0d5p0s1w4"
              ARPABET="EY CH OW"
              time="113.57"
              dur="0.31"
            >eco</w>-<w
              id="t0b0d5p0s1w5"
              ARPABET="Y V P EY N"
              time="113.88"
              dur="0.61"
            >yvpen</w> ’<w
              id="t0b0d5p0s1w6"
              ARPABET="S EY K OW HH L IY CH EY T"
              time="114.83"
              dur="1.45"
            >sekohlicet</w></s><s
            do-not-align="true"
            id="t0b0d5p0s1"
            sentence-id="t0b0d5p0s1"
            class="sentence__translation editable__translation"
            xml:lang="eng"
          >and Deer lent them to him. So Rabbit put the deer antlers on his head </s>
                    <s id="t0b0d5p0s2">’<w
              id="t0b0d5p0s2w0"
              ARPABET="S AA D V T EY S"
              time="116.42"
              dur="1"
            >sarvtēs</w>. “<w
              id="t0b0d5p0s2w1"
              ARPABET="EY S L EY T K IY T"
              time="118.58"
              dur="0.93"
            >Eslētkit</w> ’<w
              id="t0b0d5p0s2w2"
              ARPABET="S AA D IY N"
              time="119.51"
              dur="0.83"
            >sarin</w> <w
              id="t0b0d5p0s2w3"
              ARPABET="HH EY CH V K EY T S"
              time="120.79"
              dur="0.99"
            >hecvkēts</w>” <w
              id="t0b0d5p0s2w4"
              ARPABET="K IY CH EY N HH"
              time="121.91"
              dur="0.64"
            >kicen,</w></s><s
            do-not-align="true"
            id="t0b0d5p0s2"
            sentence-id="t0b0d5p0s2"
            class="sentence__translation editable__translation"
            xml:lang="eng"
          >and went around with them. “Let’s see me run around with them,” he said.</s>
                    <s id="t0b0d5p0s3">“<w
              id="t0b0d5p0s3w0"
              ARPABET="EY N K AA"
              time="123.1"
              dur="0.62"
            >Enka</w>” <w
              id="t0b0d5p0s3w1"
              ARPABET="K IY HH CH EY N HH"
              time="123.72"
              dur="0.73"
            >kihcen,</w> <w
              id="t0b0d5p0s3w2"
              ARPABET="CH UW F EY"
              time="124.65"
              dur="0.35"
            >Cufe</w> <w
              id="t0b0d5p0s3w3"
              ARPABET="T AA T"
              time="125"
              dur="0.37"
            >tat</w> ’<w
              id="t0b0d5p0s3w4"
              ARPABET="S EY K OW HH L IY CH EY T"
              time="126"
              dur="1.4"
            >sekohlicet</w> <w
              id="t0b0d5p0s3w5"
              ARPABET="EY S L EY T K EY T"
              time="127.81"
              dur="0.89"
            >eslētket</w> ’<w
              id="t0b0d5p0s3w6"
              ARPABET="S AA D V T EY S"
              time="128.7"
              dur="1"
            >sarvtēs</w>.</s><s
            do-not-align="true"
            id="t0b0d5p0s3"
            sentence-id="t0b0d5p0s3"
            class="sentence__translation editable__translation"
            xml:lang="eng"
          >“Okay,” Deer said, and Rabbit put them on his head and ran around with them.</s>
                </p>
            <graphic url="image-eco-ton-momen-c-20261110164718-5.png" /></div>
            <div type="page" id="t0b0d6">
